[
  {
    "id": "hero",
    "nome": "Hero",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Narrow:wght@500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><header><section style=\"background:#ffffff\" aria-label=\"Hero\"><div style=\"max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:2.75rem 1.5rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr;gap:3rem;align-items:center\"><div><h1 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',Arial Narrow,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(2rem,4.2vw,3.2rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 1rem;max-width:18ch\">Scende dal tetto, risolve in un'ora, risale.</h1><p style=\"font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.55;color:#52575c;max-width:46ch;margin:0 0 1.75rem\">Interventi in quota senza ponteggi: grondaie, facciate, tetti e messa in sicurezza, con tecnici certificati che raggiungono ogni punto dell'edificio in meno di 60 minuti.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a href=\"#pricing\" onclick=\"trackClick('edilextreme','preventivo-hero','Preventivo',0)\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;padding:.8rem 1.5rem;background:#e8b923;color:#1c2024;text-decoration:none;border-radius:2px\">Richiedi preventivo</a><a href=\"#servizi\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;padding:.8rem 1.5rem;border:1px solid #c7ccd1;color:#1c2024;text-decoration:none;border-radius:2px\">Guarda i servizi</a></div></div><div style=\"border-left:1px solid #e4e2da;padding-left:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25rem\"><div><b style=\"display:block;font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:700;color:#a07a10;line-height:1\">&minus;40%</b><span style=\"display:block;font-size:.8rem;color:#767b80;margin-top:.25rem\">sui costi rispetto al ponteggio</span></div><div><b style=\"display:block;font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:700;color:#a07a10;line-height:1\">&lt;60&prime;</b><span style=\"display:block;font-size:.8rem;color:#767b80;margin-top:.25rem\">per raggiungere ogni punto</span></div><div><b style=\"display:block;font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:700;color:#a07a10;line-height:1\">0</b><span style=\"display:block;font-size:.8rem;color:#767b80;margin-top:.25rem\">ponteggi, 0 impalcature</span></div></div></div></section></header>"
  },
  {
    "id": "whatis",
    "nome": "Perché lavorare su fune",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<section style=\"background:#ffffff;padding:5rem 1.5rem;border-top:1px solid #e4e2da\" id=\"whatis\" aria-labelledby=\"whatis-title\">\n  <div class=\"eext-2col\" style=\"max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr;gap:3.5rem\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 id=\"whatis-title\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,2.6rem);line-height:1.1;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 1.25rem\">Perché lavorare su fune</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.7;color:#4a4f54;max-width:36ch;margin:0\">Le tecniche di accesso su corda, che hanno origini alpinisiche, permettono di intervenire su qualsiasi edificio senza le settimane di attesa e i costi di un ponteggio tradizionale.</p>\n    </div>\n    <ol style=\"list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0\">\n      <li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.5rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dad5;align-items:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#a07a10;font-size:1rem\">01</span><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.55;color:#2c2f32\"><strong>Intervento mirato:</strong> si arriva dritti al punto del problema, anche nelle zone più difficili da raggiungere.</p></li>\n      <li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.5rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dad5;align-items:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#a07a10;font-size:1rem\">02</span><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.55;color:#2c2f32\"><strong>Zero strutture temporanee:</strong> niente noleggio o montaggio di ponteggi e piattaforme aeree.</p></li>\n      <li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.5rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dad5;align-items:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#a07a10;font-size:1rem\">03</span><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.55;color:#2c2f32\"><strong>Fino al 40% in meno:</strong> il risparmio arriva dall'assenza di strutture e tempi di montaggio.</p></li>\n      <li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.5rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 0;align-items:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#a07a10;font-size:1rem\">04</span><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.55;color:#2c2f32\"><strong>Meno burocrazia:</strong> minori permessi e documentazione rispetto ai cantieri tradizionali.</p></li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  },
  {
    "id": "stack",
    "nome": "Sei motivi per fidarsi",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<section style=\"background:#ffffff;padding:5rem 1.5rem;border-top:1px solid #e4e2da\" id=\"stack\" aria-labelledby=\"stack-title\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto\">\n    <h2 id=\"stack-title\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,2.6rem);color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 3rem;max-width:20ch\">Sei motivi per fidarsi</h2>\n    <div class=\"eext-3col\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2.5rem 2rem\">\n      <article style=\"border-left:2px solid #e8b923;padding-left:1.25rem\"><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .6rem\">Totale sicurezza</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4f54\">Tecnici certificati, aggiornati regolarmente con istruttori di alpinismo e speleologia.</p></article>\n      <article style=\"border-left:2px solid #e8b923;padding-left:1.25rem\"><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .6rem\">Accesso senza limiti</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4f54\">Raggiungiamo ogni angolo dell'edificio, anche i punti più complessi da raggiungere.</p></article>\n      <article style=\"border-left:2px solid #e8b923;padding-left:1.25rem\"><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .6rem\">Prezzi trasparenti</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4f54\">Niente ponteggi né macchinari costosi: qualità alta, spesa contenuta.</p></article>\n      <article style=\"border-left:2px solid #e8b923;padding-left:1.25rem\"><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .6rem\">Interventi rapidi</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4f54\">Basta un punto di ancoraggio sicuro per iniziare i lavori lo stesso giorno.</p></article>\n      <article style=\"border-left:2px solid #e8b923;padding-left:1.25rem\"><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .6rem\">Zero ponteggi</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4f54\">I nostri operatori intervengono in meno di un'ora dall'arrivo sul posto.</p></article>\n      <article style=\"border-left:2px solid #e8b923;padding-left:1.25rem\"><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .6rem\">Assistenza continua</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4f54\">Dalla consulenza iniziale al supporto post-intervento, ti seguiamo in ogni fase.</p></article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  },
  {
    "id": "features",
    "nome": "Servizi",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<section style=\"background:#ffffff;padding:5rem 1.5rem;border-top:1px solid #e4e2da\" id=\"features\" aria-labelledby=\"features-title\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto 2.5rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e2da;padding-bottom:1.75rem\">\n    <h2 id=\"features-title\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,2.6rem);color:#1c2024;margin:0\">Servizi</h2>\n    <p style=\"color:#767b80;font-size:1rem;max-width:32ch;margin:0\">Dodici interventi, un solo metodo: accesso su corda, nessun ponteggio.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"eext-2col-flat\" style=\"max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:0\">\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-right:1px solid #e9e7e0;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">01</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/impermeabilizzazione-su-fune/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Impermeabilizzazione su fune</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Terrazzi, tetti e lastre protetti dall'acqua e dagli agenti atmosferici.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">02</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/riparazione-e-pulizia-grondaie/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Riparazione e pulizia grondaie</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Pulizia e sostituzione di ogni tipo di componente.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-right:1px solid #e9e7e0;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">03</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/montaggio-isolanti/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Montaggio isolanti</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Isolamento termico eseguito in quota senza ponteggi.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">04</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/pulizia-manutenzione-e-installazione-canne-fumarie/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Canne fumarie</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Pulizia, manutenzione e installazione anche in copertura.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-right:1px solid #e9e7e0;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">05</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/installazione-e-manutenzione-dissuasori-per-piccioni/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Dissuasori per piccioni</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Installazione e manutenzione di sistemi anti-volatili.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">06</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/montaggio-sistemi-di-sicurezza-su-fune/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Sistemi di sicurezza su fune</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Montaggio linee vita e ancoraggi certificati.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-right:1px solid #e9e7e0;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">07</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/rimozione-materiale-pericolante/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Messa in sicurezza</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Rimozione urgente di materiale pericolante su fune.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">08</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/potatura-alberi/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Potatura alberi</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Interventi su piante alte e difficili da raggiungere.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-right:1px solid #e9e7e0;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">09</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/pulizia-componenti-su-fune/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Pulizia componenti su fune</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Pulizia mirata di elementi in quota su ogni edificio.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">10</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/pulizia-pannelli-fotovoltaici/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Pulizia pannelli fotovoltaici</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Manutenzione per mantenere alta l'efficienza dell'impianto.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-right:1px solid #e9e7e0;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">11</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/pulizia-vetri/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Pulizia vetri in altezza</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Vetrate di palazzi e grattacieli, anche nei casi piu complessi.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">12</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\"><a href=\"https://cialdecompatibili-netizen.github.io/edilextreme4/servizi/ristrutturazioni-balconi-e-facciate/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Balconi, facciate e tetto</a></h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Ristrutturazione e ripristino estetico e strutturale.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  },
  {
    "id": "pricing",
    "nome": "Preventivo",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<section style=\"background:#ffffff;padding:5rem 1.5rem;border-top:1px solid #e4e2da\" id=\"pricing\" aria-labelledby=\"pricing-title\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center\">\n    <h2 id=\"pricing-title\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,2.6rem);color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .75rem\">Preventivo gratuito, sopralluogo incluso</h2>\n    <p style=\"color:#767b80;font-size:1.05rem;margin:0 0 2.25rem\">Un solo modulo, rispondiamo entro 24 ore, festivi esclusi.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" onclick=\"trackClick('edilextreme','preventivo','Preventivo',0)\" style=\"display:inline-flex;font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;padding:.95rem 2.25rem;background:#e8b923;color:#1c2024;text-decoration:none;border-radius:2px\">Richiedi preventivo</a>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  },
  {
    "id": "cta",
    "nome": "CTA finale",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<section style=\"background:#ffffff;padding:5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #e4e2da\" aria-labelledby=\"cta-title\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto\">\n    <h2 id=\"cta-title\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.6vw,2.6rem);color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 1rem\">Pronto a iniziare?</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4f54;margin:0 0 2.25rem\">Compila il modulo: rispondiamo entro 24 ore, festivi esclusi.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" style=\"display:inline-flex;font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:.95rem 1.9rem;background:#1c2024;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:2px\">Richiedi preventivo</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n@media(max-width:820px){\n  header section > div{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}\n  header section > div > div:last-child{border-left:none!important;padding-left:0!important;border-top:1px solid #e4e2da;padding-top:1.5rem;flex-direction:row!important;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.75rem!important}\n  .eext-2col{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:2rem!important}\n  .eext-3col{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}\n  .eext-2col-flat{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}\n  .eext-2col-flat .eext-cell-r{border-right:none!important}\n  .eext-2col-flat > div{border-right:none!important}\n  .eext-pricing{flex-direction:column!important}\n  .eext-pricing .eext-cell-r{border-right:none!important;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e2da}\n}\n@media(max-width:480px){\n  section{padding-left:1.25rem!important;padding-right:1.25rem!important}\n}\n</style>"
  }
]